  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektledare f&#xf6;r utveckling av fastighets- och landinformations- system i Ukraina.Till&#xe4;ggsinsats till lantm&#xe4;teriprojektet i Ukraina som varit verksamt sedan 1994, d&#xe4;r nu en f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av projekt- ledartiden beviljas med 4 m&#xe5;nader.Ukrainsk part &#xe4;r Main Administrati of Geodesy, Cartography and Cadastre. Swedish counterpart=Swedsurvey</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This third addition to the cadastre- and landsurvey project in Ukraine includes an extension of the contract for the project co-ordinator for 4 months. The local counterpart is the Main Administration of Geodesy, Cartography and Cadastre. The swedish counterpart is Swedsurvey.</narrative>
